---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---
<BaseLayout title="Terms | Low Value Content" description="Terms of use for the Low Value Content and Royal House of Engagement pre-launch website.">
  <article class="policy">
    <header><p class="eyebrow">Draft · October 16, 2026</p><h1>Website terms.</h1><p>Terms for this pre-launch concept storefront. These must be reviewed and expanded before general commerce, accounts, submissions, or promotions are enabled.</p></header>
    <section><h2>Current purpose</h2><p>This website presents working creative concepts for Low Value Content and its fictional realm, the Royal House of Engagement. One restricted test-checkout configuration exists for validation, but the site does not currently offer products for general public sale.</p></section>
    <section><h2>Creative material</h2><p>Site copy, artwork, mockups, heraldry, and logo studies are provided for viewing only. Copyright © 2026 Low Value Content, an imprint of Nelson Grey LLC. All rights reserved. Display of a name or phrase does not represent that it is registered, exclusive, or cleared for commercial use.</p></section>
    <section><h2>No warranties</h2><p>Concepts and planning information may change. The site is provided as available without a promise that every feature, product, price, specification, title, observance, or release described will become commercially available.</p></section>
    <section><h2>Acceptable use</h2><p>Do not interfere with the site, attempt unauthorized access, disrupt its services, or reproduce its creative material as merchandise without written permission.</p></section>
    <section><h2>Commerce readiness</h2><p>Before public sales begin, these terms will be updated with purchase, payment, fulfillment, shipping, returns, replacements, and jurisdiction provisions. Product pages and checkout notices will identify the terms applicable at that time.</p></section>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
<style>
  .policy{padding:clamp(5rem,10vw,10rem) clamp(1.25rem,9vw,10rem);background:var(--paper)}
  header{max-width:900px;margin-bottom:5rem}h1{font-size:clamp(4rem,9vw,9rem);line-height:.86;font-weight:400;margin:1rem 0 2rem}header>p:last-child{max-width:760px;font-size:1.25rem;line-height:1.7}.policy section{max-width:820px;padding:2.25rem 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}h2{font-size:2rem;font-weight:400;margin:.2rem 0 1rem}.policy section p{line-height:1.75;margin:0}
</style>
